<title>USA: Exxon replaces 108 pct of production in 1996.</title>
<headline>Exxon replaces 108 pct of production in 1996.</headline>
<dateline>IRVING, Texas 1997-02-06</dateline>
<text>
<p>Exxon Corp said Thursday its worldwide additions to proved oil and gas reserves totaled more than 1.1 billion oil-equivalent barrels in 1996, replacing 108 percent of its production.</p>
</text>
